Changes by PQC Today, LLC (June to September 2026)
--------------------------------------------------
Post-quantum OpenPGP (draft-ietf-openpgp-pqc) through a PKCS#11 v3.2 token:
ML-DSA composite signing (MLDSA65_Ed25519, MLDSA87_Ed448), ML-KEM composite
decryption (MLKEM768_X25519, MLKEM1024_X448), standalone Ed448 signing,
in-token key generation; ported to sequoia-openpgp 2.x and cryptoki 0.12;
openpgp-x509-sequoia inlined; rsa 0.9 and x509-certificate 0.25.

Modified upstream files (each carries a "Modified by" line):
  lib/Cargo.toml, cli/Cargo.toml, lib/src/lib.rs, lib/src/decryptor.rs,
  lib/src/signer.rs, lib/src/upload.rs, lib/src/util.rs, lib/src/x509.rs,
  cli/src/bin/opgpkcs11.rs, README.md, lib/README.md, cli/README.md,
  .gitignore
New files written by PQC Today, LLC: Cargo.lock, docs/, smoke-import/,
smoke-mldsa/, smoke-mlkem/, spike-pqc/ (their sources carry their own SPDX tags).
The git history of this folder records every change and its date.

